  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e77fafa5c7e00963558eb49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハハッ、今なら手に入らないもんは\r\nない！さあ、ロマンも名声も\r\nアタシがいただくぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86c0f079810a54bf2c2e0cf6a153d0737450bbb6d2a59e5badbb024d13675cbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:179636caac404bc0239abca6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "風向き上々！いい船旅ができそうだ\r\n出航と行こうか、トレーナー。\r\n向かう先は…勝利！そして名声だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d185663d04baab48780b2808a325c070bfa0f771e7d81d47c7e1c760d8dffbe5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba2c5fb4e2338c206dbc1a77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "なかなかの調整だ！\r\nみんなアタシのリズムに釘付けに\r\nなるだろう！もちろん、アンタも！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67207ec8b844671e40d9d2abac88e590a11316fdf6dea313e89f3609b99f0096",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e93d31f8e5ae82450ebbf5dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これだけ整っていれば十分！\r\nさ、始めようじゃないか。\r\nロマンを求めて、今日も走るぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "387f21e79c9d21b6f84930a050c3f9c24495378cd79ae73a43891102cb1525df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad32f5a84eca2ac8f449b132",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ま、今は燃えていなくても問題ない\r\nボルテージならこれから上げて\r\nいくさ！アタシの、この脚でな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae715c43ef2314f9c13c248268a40a77e5c33935944436fb18673c85201b8402",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f997eb0bcddc6b37c3ac757",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どこでも笑えるのがアタシの\r\n強みだからな。今はパッとしなく\r\nても、レースが始まれば…さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ae90d261e54b603ae4bc6cac9e1169551d89174ee4419824903d8907a1fcb06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fddc054818187ac8ff95b1ce",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hm…調子は良くも悪くもなく。\r\nそれじゃ、ここから上げていこう！\r\n波に乗らないと、だろう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef5d3b14f2bb20dd972b0ff624a51d9643ae914662033934d88148607642ce4d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af1d3bd7d02a2f230bcfe7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整不足とか、細かいことはもう\r\n気にしても仕方ない。今を楽しめ！\r\n今を感じろ！それだけさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a453f07981c13a1ad0e09d164492fa34ece55e94c564380ba9438746d10318a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a614f59e66cd84c9b7df4bb1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調整はイマイチだが、どんな航海に\r\nだって嵐は待ち構えているものさ。\r\nむしろ燃えるってもんだ、ハハッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df1bc72b68cc535f2a7c88299fef93aae01c8a8accf8d4f60c43a9fc5553f9d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4695f3aceb9f927b6f12ba15",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子がイマイチでも、いつだって\r\nそこにいるヤツらと楽しむって\r\n決めてんだ。さあ、宴に向かおう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7969e88ec409a2d43949b3b6ad30c9eace525d71de13778d5282f8746b4cb7d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c55c81844724b9f62ae0308",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "せっかくのショータイムに、\r\nこんな重い脚で来ちまった！\r\n…ま、逆境だってオツなもんさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8503d3b06237d8a58defc8b0c4693898d18c813a45f747b570802b8ee4d7f7c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d1345f4d4a77857fc7caf29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調子っぱずれな曲が足元を\r\n狂わせているような…そんな感覚だ\r\nまあ、イマイチでもやってやるさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e0d8a054e034efe3b5bf4a7145defc58cc8d30d1f6545e7a4d8f31aed5edafd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20036"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e4c2f8f97587bdc711958d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "試されてるのか…？まあ、いいさ。\r\n城も、夢も、ロマンも…全部手に\r\n入れるとこ、見せてやる…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfcbaeeded80f98dc45f46e17c31d8e83d40e3cc9e1ca97e62f22812953ddbc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20037"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35cee1ef616f2062fa5474b0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c28d8c17e90bdb78b07f71914dd1c96c0080d88f35e7f8a8a57add7f9b4925c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20038"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8742f606210cdb47ea342b70",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任せな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df2a172c7ac6302292c63714f233a333f6ef8ed0c1385142b9e410bd13b48644",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20039"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7acf77bc4ed2d52e9956d704",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "My Turn!",
      "source_fingerprint": "e32542d78ce1a8a954bc41f3a412651cf3dcfa297f7b79ef6519229b2f6f4190",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20040"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f5874da4060f4bf2a1394bf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Study time.",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e8991e04b220a4db561317007126b06830820ee4551c1ca56ead5ce8a997dde",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f32515e2033a6a0c255cc54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Oh…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b365330eb32521995cdb94d22e9062b15fb6c4744c079171a2b233cfc901688",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2140057181df72f46887ced3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "I'm tired….",
      "source_fingerprint": "d391efa62b70bc4631eab11adf1cebda7b68d5ccf1b9f4741d827c4edec25249",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48453d6da632f08a03e1f453",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "羽目を外すぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "24fc22dbe138fad2a05f328f3c9006a7275acdc12d6db860bdcb497f2ce49857",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c2fff1403db21b963dc265d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冒険だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8b12ba8d86dbd001780998ededc67b72630d04d8974f5e9a096faf718db16cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb7a93e84480b319db4b4d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アンタとのダンス、\r\n楽しくてあっという間だったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b763caf70003a69953a0437f7a1a0ed91164a9416694d1c95b74bda98affa025",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fcc4978e29f81f4880a42e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Thanks, なかなか刺激的だったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8db4e948e0dcc79adcd9e336615c0ac17d4e0725a61e763f43ebc7e5bc32861",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37f2169cc14a05dfb29c6a33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、アンタも踊ろうぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0642109c74059aad91e563eae2cc2dc41384b3edb019581a6aa0a45b47bf4687",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9363c2dc602d5d7cf5e9c6c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アタシと踊ろうぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9ff1ea38137289c0d193bac34e11806842427c9d94d1601d6027e6d94fbcb50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "2030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c51310d12111c67a95242d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "躍れ躍れっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ad3884645a7f5339866b481a0c08447440583a137f9a27a7341f22b7647b768",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "2031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:441a15f2154809fba9e22df8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Thanks, なかなか刺激的だったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8db4e948e0dcc79adcd9e336615c0ac17d4e0725a61e763f43ebc7e5bc32861",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "2032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15c18def317ce1c73cb1ab7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これだけ整っていれば十分！\r\nさ、始めようじゃないか。\r\nロマンを求めて、今日も走るぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "387f21e79c9d21b6f84930a050c3f9c24495378cd79ae73a43891102cb1525df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "2033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60957087b77570a58aaa7480",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハハッ、今なら手に入らないもんは\r\nない！さあ、ロマンも名声も\r\nアタシがいただくぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "86c0f079810a54bf2c2e0cf6a153d0737450bbb6d2a59e5badbb024d13675cbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "2034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f4c19ac3961462eea698d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Thanks, なかなか刺激的だったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8db4e948e0dcc79adcd9e336615c0ac17d4e0725a61e763f43ebc7e5bc32861",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "2035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e40bf43eb21ac278298af87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2c28d8c17e90bdb78b07f71914dd1c96c0080d88f35e7f8a8a57add7f9b4925c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "23015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2748d14cd8e04387d0d8b80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Close!次は逃がさないぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "70945fcd8686d13f7a0e8d399767fddc8d8574dd9f1404f6d45b557554b696b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "30000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:916a7164151f800d04e88d10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クッ、ハハ！あー、強いなクソッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1dd07f04535d516cd636f9e5d45467c1402f986c4684849dd9d5bbb143f99c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "30001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c913f7068566943170670d72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Hmm...not good.",
      "source_fingerprint": "f35e7dc4abe820e10ae34f6017f1c686abaaca45cd85729ff4a659ceca0295b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "30002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e0220b2f0be313bd2b17f8ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クソッ、しくじった…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9add3ac4ff2b6a5ca188784bd7508ad163e2a88856380d6497a1af3ca8e0f92c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "30003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e78bb65d0a2d760aa79234f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "楽しんだか？興奮したか？\r\nもっと声出せ！Woo!",
      "source_fingerprint": "398f747d45b7767842fa34fa8796881fb8224f43f75beba437a6a5a150f765f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "30004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0054bd59e0f8fa3bf7e68020",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Thanks, everyone!…And you♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0ebaac179923bb344c5c848036be0ca6d908d2b6bba43a7d647d5f143c16cdc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "30005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ffb712f2d94667cea563381",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "イッツショータイム！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cb8dd80a36ec30a08e84a5b0695e5f9f5b101d01f5b48593dd6581358cd8b74",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "31000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a3bf63731db4a78ffd773cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ロマンの城に招待だ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a65fa3edac051f0fc914de02212b406fa1d3bfa228be26bcf8949552ca9437c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "40000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d026da974d7cddc3b226fecc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞台さ、もっと派手に作ろうぜ！\r\nいっそ学園中をでっかい城にして…\r\nな、やっちまおうよ！　アハハッ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fc319a042d85e5e91a8ce7cfad6ce2b97f106d9c45baf09b1a3b367f088a9e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:451cc5aeb93fa75eabcdb074",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんなことがあっても、\r\n仲間が集まりゃ解決できるさ！\r\nあとは本番、楽しむだけだな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "306e930bc21b8a11a57ccc8909360a9047758a2ef6839472edcddbfb5ae865bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "400005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:817eec1836d25316a9bcc3bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、夢と踊ろうぜ！\r\n欲しいもん！溢れるロマン！望むがままに手に入れる！\r\nそれがアタシの生き様さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a39a48d3361cab4d9b52456fefa4e142d45a12ec2415abd0a43b9a1aae9102b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba3cb48c3e578e833bc33a17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ踊ろう！　歌おう！\r\n円になって、肩を組んで！\r\n今を楽しもう、ただ“今”を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f9d847e93f924cf371a490a479406030600906cd9468d5fc38dd8d4bd311740",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "400011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc82b96aa7675f98e5df5e64",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Okay!宴の始まりだっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbc15a8e32be2d2c59e78bcdffa969d7b1634eef1737a28420463a3a18f64339",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1107",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2e7eb5a42419224920d4b1c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Come on!踊りまくるぞ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "425c1502b04bcdc1d4321fe83f87f0c2090b3d21516b7d97316a498a6fd61432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
